  "title": "In the Hot Seat: Will Brophy on Rescheduling, Banking Reform, and the Reality of Cannabis Markets",
  "summary": "At a Gotham and Cultivated Media event in New York City, Will Brophy, COO of Nabis, took the Hot Seat for a rapid-fire conversation on the realities shaping today’s cannabis industry. From federal rescheduling and banking reform to capital constraints and market maturity, Brophy cut through common misconceptions to offer a grounded, operator-first perspective on what’s actually changing and what challenges remain.",
